oatpp-openssl
------------------------------------------
This submodule provides secure server and client connection providers for oatpp
applications. Based on OpenSSL.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  liboatpp-openssl1-1.3.0-1bl2
  liboatpp1-1.3.1-1bl2
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  liboatpp-devel-1.3.1-1bl2
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/oatpp/oatpp-openssl

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/oatpp/oatpp-openssl/archive/refs/tags/1.3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack oatpp-openssl-1.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./oatpp-openssl-1.3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/oatpp-openssl-1.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/oatpp-openssl-1.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liboatpp-openssl1-1.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liboatpp-openssl-devel-1.3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

